1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,500
Now Harari makes it personal.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:11,796
He is all too familiar with such crass egotism, he says, because the Jews, his own people, also think they are the most important thing in the world.

3
00:00:11,796 --> 00:00:19,557
Name any human achievement, and they will quickly claim credit for it, and they are genuinely convinced.

